# Copy to supabase/functions/.env only if you need extra secrets for
# `supabase functions serve`. Do not commit .env.
#
# SUPABASE_URL, SUPABASE_ANON_KEY, and SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY are injected
# automatically by the Supabase CLI when serving locally, and by the hosted
# project for deploy. The service role key must never appear in Expo /
# EXPO_PUBLIC_* env or in the app bundle.
